       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TEMPERATURE-CONVERTER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 CELSIUS-VALUE PIC S9(3)V9(2).
       01 FAHRENHEIT-VALUE PIC S9(3)V9(2).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "Enter Celsius: " WITH NO ADVANCING.
           ACCEPT CELSIUS-VALUE.
           COMPUTE FAHRENHEIT-VALUE = (CELSIUS-VALUE * 9 / 5) + 32.
           DISPLAY "Fahrenheit: " FAHRENHEIT-VALUE.
           STOP RUN.
